{"id":"n66031-3-7","stage":0,"title":"맑다 · 清脆","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66031-3-7-1","ko":"제 목소리 어때요?","zh":"我的声音怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제","meaning":"我的（谦称）","explanation":"제：저의 的缩略，是“我的”的谦称。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"목소리","meaning":"嗓音，声音","explanation":"목소리：嗓音，声音。","readings":[{"term":"목소리","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69464","senseId":"1","lemma":"목소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목소리","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3"}},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때요","audio":"/audio/6dbf157a4dc7e6e8b537.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"47febdd9f8a45735","term":"목소리","zh":"嗓音，声音","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3","entryId":"69464","definition":"从人喉咙里发出的声音。","pronunciation":["목쏘리"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/31e8daad735db869b57d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66031-3-7-2","ko":"넌 목소리가 정말 맑아서 아나운서를 해도 되겠다.","zh":"你的声音这么清亮，都能当播音员了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你（话题）","explanation":"넌 是 너는 的缩略，表示“你”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넌","audio":"/audio/6a4a5bffadc879e8d8ac.mp3"}},{"text":"목소리가","meaning":"嗓音，声音","explanation":"목소리：嗓音，声音；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"목소리","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69464","senseId":"1","lemma":"목소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목소리가","audio":"/audio/74012d13a64ca3e5b621.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"맑아서","meaning":"因为清亮","explanation":"맑다：声音清澈响亮；-아서 表示能够当播音员的原因。","readings":[{"term":"맑다","audio":"/audio/c8398a865a7478831698.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66031","senseId":"3","lemma":"맑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맑아서","audio":"/audio/edae83612dacc2dc7800.mp3"}},{"text":"아나운서를","meaning":"播音员","explanation":"아나운서：播音员；-를 标记 하다 的宾语，아나운서를 하다 是“当播音员”。","readings":[{"term":"아나운서","audio":"/audio/9de89526fae7b1603dc3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65976","senseId":"1","lemma":"아나운서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아나운서를","audio":"/audio/d8663a2ef305b5568edc.mp3"}},{"text":"해도","meaning":"即使当……也","explanation":"하다：从事（职业）；-아/어도 与后面的 되다 合用，表示“即便当播音员也可以”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해도","audio":"/audio/9812d340bbecfd44e4d1.mp3"}},{"text":"되겠다.","meaning":"也可以","explanation":"-아/어도 되다 表示可以；-겠- 表示推测，赞许对方适合当播音员。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surface